Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: package HDR output and HBR3
 hotplug

Add kernel patches 0117-0122 for HBR3, HDR signalling and refreshed sink link capabilities when switching monitors. Advance to release 82.
---
 ...nstantnoodlep-allow-DisplayPort-link.patch |  29 +++
 ...l-the-colorimetry-of-RGB-streams-in-.patch | 101 ++++++++++
 ...HDR-static-metadata-as-an-infoframe-.patch | 185 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...-SDPs-through-SDP_CFG3-on-revision-1.patch |  69 +++++++
 ...e-Colorspace-and-HDR_OUTPUT_METADATA.patch | 167 ++++++++++++++++
 ...-link-capabilities-on-sink-discovery.patch |  32 +++
 .../linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/APKBUILD   |  14 +-
 7 files changed, 596 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0117-arm64-dts-qcom-instantnoodlep-allow-DisplayPort-link.patch
