 	0114-media-i2c-imx471-use-30-fps-for-the-binned-mode.patch
 	0115-drm-panel-samsung-ams678uw01-power-off-when-the-PPS-.patch
 	0116-soc-qcom-oneplus-sensor-devinfo-bound-the-SAR-channe.patch
+	0117-arm64-dts-qcom-instantnoodlep-allow-DisplayPort-link.patch
+	0118-drm-msm-dp-signal-the-colorimetry-of-RGB-streams-in-.patch
+	0119-drm-msm-dp-send-HDR-static-metadata-as-an-infoframe-.patch
+	0120-drm-msm-dp-latch-SDPs-through-SDP_CFG3-on-revision-1.patch
