 b4dc9ab0dfcb76beb508853856745f6c8d217f0fe116c52766341f490ae366e0db09e343a742db55a7e81bad2b907ba0294a9ebc05f9f9503a4481369cbb2a50  0114-media-i2c-imx471-use-30-fps-for-the-binned-mode.patch
 43c09c515743fc28c7ba5916f6d1940f85e95e8e23c68cb70d42a7a3ae8d9d31abf90247249561fd3ec5945662522cc59a11dfedbe02502824aa183569820587  0115-drm-panel-samsung-ams678uw01-power-off-when-the-PPS-.patch
 2a3a8e0fcd40450b45d22aee24417e5995dbad203c41813f399c18381a23618ca3adec03ef76e585d0822f5b54e26b325c01232f689e302ef8844502899e4e27  0116-soc-qcom-oneplus-sensor-devinfo-bound-the-SAR-channe.patch
+b546c241e74367fb9f0b59d48d87d5e03d48536a99f17361cdb854e20877e0550eb3289732c795b1a8a49e090d96ced608d5d7c99f21dad352110fe005f8a79b  0117-arm64-dts-qcom-instantnoodlep-allow-DisplayPort-link.patch
+71cfa4ecf54d560ed457d09708224645f892d8fd964822f72c1837fc06fa14301990b94a49e60831320ee46dd8003b082d646be306da4085215849c4d8799966  0118-drm-msm-dp-signal-the-colorimetry-of-RGB-streams-in-.patch
